1
00:00:02,500 --> 00:00:04,780
90% software engineers ko lagta hai

2
00:00:04,800 --> 00:00:07,040
ki unka project bilkul safe hai —

3
00:00:07,060 --> 00:00:08,380
lekin asliyat yeh hai ki

4
00:00:08,400 --> 00:00:09,860
aapke code mein kam se kam

5
00:00:09,880 --> 00:00:11,600
4 aisi libraries chal rahi hain

6
00:00:11,620 --> 00:00:13,160
jo andar se poori tarah

7
00:00:13,180 --> 00:00:14,380
‘mar’ chuki hain!

8
00:00:14,400 --> 00:00:16,120
Jab aap npm install karte hain

9
00:00:16,140 --> 00:00:18,060
aur woh peeli warnings aati hain,

10
00:00:18,080 --> 00:00:19,960
toh aap bhi unhe ignore kar dete hain,

11
00:00:19,980 --> 00:00:20,840
right?

12
00:00:20,860 --> 00:00:22,380
Sabse bada khatra yeh hai ki

13
00:00:22,400 --> 00:00:24,880
jo library saalon se laawaris padi hai,

14
00:00:24,900 --> 00:00:26,900
uska kabhi koi security update

15
00:00:26,920 --> 00:00:27,460
nahi aayega.

16
00:00:27,480 --> 00:00:30,000
Hackers inhi dead libraries ke zariye

17
00:00:30,020 --> 00:00:32,160
companies ke server hack karte hain —

18
00:00:32,180 --> 00:00:33,720
aur aapka regular scanner bolega

19
00:00:33,740 --> 00:00:35,960
“All green, no issue!”

20
00:00:35,980 --> 00:00:38,140
Isi problem ko jad se khatm karne ke liye

21
00:00:38,160 --> 00:00:40,400
ek Indian developer, Taha Kotwal ne

22
00:00:40,420 --> 00:00:42,580
banaya hai — Graveyard Check.

23
00:00:42,600 --> 00:00:45,120
Bas apne terminal mein ek single command chalao —

24
00:00:45,140 --> 00:00:47,300
aur yeh 3 second mein aapki poori

25
00:00:47,320 --> 00:00:49,680
npm ya Python dependency scan karke

26
00:00:49,700 --> 00:00:51,580
bata dega ki kaun sa package

27
00:00:51,600 --> 00:00:53,520
4 saal se band pada hai!

28
00:00:53,540 --> 00:00:55,800
Aur sabse bada ‘jaadoo’ kya hai pata hai?

29
00:00:55,820 --> 00:00:57,460
Yeh sirf bimaari nahi batata —

30
00:00:57,480 --> 00:00:59,140
dawa bhi deta hai!

31
00:00:59,160 --> 00:01:01,060
Agar aapka request package dead hai,

32
00:01:01,080 --> 00:01:02,440
toh yeh khud bolega —

33
00:01:02,460 --> 00:01:03,460
“bhai, ise hatao

34
00:01:03,480 --> 00:01:06,220
aur iski jagah axios ya got lagao!”

35
00:01:06,240 --> 00:01:08,000
Aap iska GitHub Action laga do,

36
00:01:08,020 --> 00:01:09,900
toh yeh production mein jaane se pehle hi

37
00:01:09,920 --> 00:01:12,000
dead code ki dhajjiyaan uda dega.

38
00:01:12,020 --> 00:01:14,560
100% free aur open-source hai,

39
00:01:14,580 --> 00:01:16,020
bina kisi signup ke.

40
00:01:16,040 --> 00:01:17,460
Agar aapko is tool ka direct

41
00:01:17,480 --> 00:01:19,580
GitHub link aur setup guide chahiye,

42
00:01:19,600 --> 00:01:21,380
toh comment mein likho “DEAD”

43
00:01:21,400 --> 00:01:23,580
link seedhe aapke DM mein aa jayega.

44
00:01:23,600 --> 00:01:25,660
GitHub pe jaakar Taha ke is project ko

45
00:01:25,680 --> 00:01:27,460
ek Star zaroor dena,

46
00:01:27,480 --> 00:01:29,580
taaki aise Indian open-source developers ko

47
00:01:29,600 --> 00:01:30,280
support mile.

48
00:01:30,300 --> 00:01:32,880
Aur aise hi hidden developer tools ke liye —

49
00:01:32,900 --> 00:01:33,900
Computer Hub ko

50
00:01:33,920 --> 00:01:35,600
abhi Follow kar lo!
